error: `a = b; b = a` doesn't swap
 --> Luau:2:1
1 | local a, b = 1, 2
2 | a = b
  | ^^^^^
3 | b = a
  | ^^^^^
help: use `a, b = b, a` to swap both at once

error: `a = b; b = a` doesn't swap
 --> Luau:2:1
1 | local f = function() local a, b = 1, 2
2 | a = b
  | ^^^^^
3 | b = a end
  | ^^^^^
help: use `a, b = b, a` to swap both at once

error: `a = b; b = a` doesn't swap
 --> Luau:2:1
